WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:04,610
Du Ling, tell your captain that you know the person who took away the loss of the steel whip.

2
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:07,610
And did you take them to find something spontaneously this time?

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:10,640
Yes, although not 100% sure

4
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,840
But I seem to have seen off-road vehicles in surveillance

5
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,840
So he took everyone to the direction of the off-road vehicle

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,240
I just didn't expect to encounter such a powerful loss

7
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,440
The team members launched an attack on the loss

8
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,840
It was just solved by the other party in an instant

9
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,930
My medical ability itself has no lethality.

10
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:28,220
So my position has always been relatively far back.

11
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,020
He voluntarily brought me back

12
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,980
What are the characteristics of powerful loss?

13
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,780
Will release extended abilities

14
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,380
You can quickly have several grinding plates wrap around and squeeze people

15
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,770
Yan Ci can accurately pierce a person's vitals

16
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:44,290
Where did I meet

17
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:46,490
This is the direction in which the off-road vehicle was driving in the surveillance system.

18
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:47,890
That should be Xinzhong District
